  "id": "bds",
  "term": "BDS",
  "definition": "BDS stands for Backward Digit Span, a task used in psychology to assess working memory, especially in children. It requires a person to hold a sequence of digits in mind and mentally reverse it, so it draws on both keeping information active and manipulating it.",
